For this class project we had to design a mechanism with a rigid bar of a fixed length, 3 pin supports of which two need to be mounted on the ground and a linear
actuator. Our mechanism was supposed to lift the heaviest possible mass the furthest distance off the ground. I made two designs, one that lifted the heaviest possible mass and one that lifted a lighter mass a further distance.
